precise or near zero to support associations, despite the smaller absolute mean giving a lower absolute 10% reference. The feature_002 high-feature_018 simple effect (H19) is tiny. These conclusions remain associations in the supplied dataset only; validation of H20 will only indicate whether that subgroup-specific association holds on independent data, not causality or broader generalizability.",
